    "enUS": {
      "dialogue": {
        "9f867d52b3c4dd3bc622": "Well met, $c.  You want some advice?  Befriend a mage!  We have a trick or two up our sleeves, we do...",
        "a27533530d43e0e63283": "I am interested in mage training.",
        "b7bf12e308ef74ab9fc3": "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew.  The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done.  It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining.  Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?",
        "e42b7fe709ff1214058d": "I am interested in mage training.",
        "eff0b98d9ccb4847bba3": "Greetings.  I'm a gnome mage trainer, and you're a mage."
      },
      "name": "Bink",
      "subName": "Mage Trainer",
      "translationMetadata": {
